{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "definition", "parent_tag": "056H", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$Z \\subset X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-scheme-theoretic-support}", "TEXTITCLOSE_0001": "}", "TEXTITOPEN_0001": "{\\it "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{definition}\n\\label{definition-scheme-theoretic-support}\n", "suffix": "\\end{definition}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:0467dea37866166d5c70888353f5bc7023203d0202d1c9d3483c03fa4d1b9180", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cb5b4fcbcc59f3a3513e15f1bd88d34ecbcc855ace1b48c0a6e6b51e3a98d420", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent\n<MATH_0003>-module of finite type. The <TEXTITOPEN_0001>scheme theoretic support\nof <MATH_0004><TEXTITCLOSE_0001> is the closed subscheme <MATH_0005> constructed in\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2b49528c9ff37720100875bfaa6b7088fb73b3bba652875b69431cf7fca1e11a", "unit_id": "tag:05JV:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "056H", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$Z$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-i-star-equivalence}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:400bb88e7b524a345768a164afc13bd354a9189a57a2a62e90363f5a94af084a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f3aac5b993691b1f5ae34cc941430e53da58e3018fbbf9955e1c1c4613cce248", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this situation we often think of <MATH_0001> as a quasi-coherent\nsheaf of finite type on <MATH_0002> (via the equivalence of categories of\nLemma <REF_0001>).\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:06847dd41abfa8dbd85711042d996b2823e9ff4aba31cdc2352e1f00aab5620a", "unit_id": "tag:056H:prose-0003"}
